ent-CitadelRPMobSkallaxYoung = young skallax
    .desc = Some sort of insect. Looks sort of like a beetle? Or a spider?
ent-CitadelRPMobSkallaxWorker = skallax worker
    .desc = An insect with yellow stripes amongst its abdomen. Bears resemblance to a beetle or a spider.
ent-CitadelRPMobSkallaxMature = mature skallax
    .desc = An old and tough looking spider-like creature.
ent-FaunaSkallaxAcid = acid spit
ent-FaunaNeurotoxinSpit = neurotoxin spit
ent-CitadelRPMobRak = rak
    .desc = A squat, armoured crustacean with heavy pincers. It keeps to itself unless provoked.
ent-CitadelRPMobRakGrey = grey rak
    .desc = { ent-CitadelRPMobRak.desc }
ent-CitadelRPFoodMeatRak = rak meat
    .desc = Pale, stringy meat from a rak.
ent-CitadelRPFoodMeatRakGrey = grey rak meat
    .desc = { ent-CitadelRPFoodMeatRak.desc }
ent-CitadelRPMobMole = giant mole
    .desc = A massive mole like creature.
ent-CitadelRPMobChameleon = chameleon
    .desc = Its skin looks... translucent, yet its flesh crawls around like it wants to leave its body.
ent-CitadelRPMobDerelictHorror = horror
    .desc = A hulking creature, towering above the usual person. Its five glowing blue eyes shine in the darkness, and its claws practically glow with some sort of energy.
ent-CitadelRPMobGeist = geist
    .desc = A floating orb of barely contained energy. It moves through the air with some sort of purpose, and fills the area around it with static electricity. Physical objects seem to just phase through it without issue, maybe energy would be different...?
ent-CitadelRPMobPhantom = ?
    .desc = Something isn't right. It's as if the shadows themselves have manifested into physical being, looking at it for too long causes whispers to start building up in your head. Oddly, projectiles just... pass through whatever this might be, melee might work better.
ent-CitadelRPMobVortex = %%$%&
    .desc = A swirling mass of matter that doesn't seem to be entirely within reality. It discharges incessant amounts of black energy that wreak havoc on the nervous system. Any projectiles seem to just phase through it, melee might work better.
ent-CitadelRPMobHallucination = WE SEE YOU
    .desc = Its form shimmers erratically, it doesn't even have a head, just a glowing ball of fire that doesn't stop burning. Your attacks don't even make it flinch. IT SEES YOU. IT KNOWS YOU. DON'T TRY TO RUN.
ent-CitadelRPMobAmbusher = crawler
    .desc = A spider-like creature that moves on an excessive amount of legs. Its flesh constantly crawls and shifts erratically, like its body can't decide on what form it wants.
ent-CitadelRPMobWriggler = leaper
    .desc = You can't quite tell what this is, considering the fact it looks more like a mouth with legs sloppily strapped onto it... Its flesh constantly shifts and wriggles around erratically. Ew.
ent-CitadelRPMobDrifter = drifter
    .desc = A gaunt, hunched figure with a glowing red crown of flesh. It shambles through the dark looking for something to tear into.
ent-CitadelRPMobScavenger = scavenger
    .desc = A long, eel-like thing that slithers through the wreckage on rows of tiny legs, snapping at anything that moves.
ent-FaunaGeistHeatBeam = heat beam
